["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Unearthed! in October 2026, Part 2 borrow pit maquette clinker-built\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-stuffmissed-中国壁画两千年不褪色-秘密是血液而非颜料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>中国壁画两千年不褪色，秘密是血液而非颜料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">左江花山岩画两千年保持鲜红，科学分析发现颜料用石灰浆混血液作粘合剂，部分血液来自产后女性，可能带有母系社会的仪式意味。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">沉船</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Missing Infrastructure for AI Agents: Documents | Reducto’s Adit Abraham VLM IDP harness recall\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-a16z-大模型处理长文档最容易犯的错-是悄悄漏掉信息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">38:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>大模型处理长文档最容易犯的错，是悄悄漏掉信息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">权威基准测试发现，顶尖大模型抽取长文档时精确率很高，但会不动声色地漏掉信息，这种错误在生产环境里几乎无法被发现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文档处理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Robinson on What It Looks Like When a State is Failing extractive institutions inclusive institutions creative destruction monopsony critical juncture\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-oddlots-诺奖得主断言-中国经济迟早要为政治集权买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">37:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>诺奖得主断言：中国经济迟早要为政治集权买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他认为中国增长靠的是经济从汲取性转向包容性制度，但政治权力从未被制衡——权力导致腐败、绝对权力导致绝对腐败，这决定了增长终将脱轨，只是时间问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">制度经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Broomology (BROOMS) with Cate O’Connell-Richards besom broomcorn johnny flying ointment broom squire Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-ologies-女巫飞天传说的真实来源-致幻药膏涂在扫帚柄上使用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>女巫飞天传说的真实来源：致幻药膏涂在扫帚柄上使用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓女巫骑扫帚飞天，脱胎自她们把含致幻生物碱的药膏涂抹在扫帚柄上、经粘膜吸收产生的飞行幻觉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民俗史</span><span class=\"tag\">手工艺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI for the Fortune 2000: How Tenex Builds an AI-Native SDLC — Alex Lieberman &amp; CJ Hess MetaHarness FDE (forward deployed engineer) RBAC AMP Kill My SaaS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-latentspace-多数企业用上了ai聊天-但智能体真正投产的不到5/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9a3ee5d13ee0cdf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>多数企业用上了AI聊天，但智能体真正投产的不到5%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企业给员工装上Claude和Codex很容易，90%已经做了；但把智能体真正部署进生产、干非工程的活，只有5%做到——这中间的落差才是这期的核心数据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI落地</span><span class=\"tag\">按产出付薪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"155. 和科沃斯钱程聊，父与子、企二代接班的样本与肌理、机器人，和我内心的追寻 physical AI FSD repetition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-21-zhangxiaojun-29岁当上科沃斯ceo-他说那是愚昧之巅不是人生巅峰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/655ca401e97f9e11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1021</span></div>\n<h2>29岁当上科沃斯CEO,他说那是愚昧之巅不是人生巅峰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他接任CEO时以为到达人生巅峰，后来才明白那是一次史诗级错判：战略方向全对，却因为不懂公司怎么做决策，两三年都没把自己和组织的神经接上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企二代接班</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#887: Q&amp;A with Tim — The 4-Hour Workweek in a World of AI, Rebuilding Personal Agency, The 4-Hour Body After 40, and More DEAL framework Oryx red teaming accelerated TMS vagal nerve stimulation Gymnastic Strength Training (GST)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-timferriss-ai不会省时间-只会把垃圾工作做得更快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>AI不会省时间，只会把垃圾工作做得更快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">没有先定义和砍掉该做的事，AI只是加速器：它不会创造闲暇，只会把琐碎、无关紧要的任务放大成更多工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人效率</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Programmable Data Center — Evan Conrad, SF Compute physical settlement cash settlement basis risk order book backplane InfiniBand fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-latentspace-英伟达造不出算力期货市场-因为做了就得放弃自己的推理生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/74ca452fc18a3198-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">36:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达造不出算力期货市场：因为做了就得放弃自己的推理生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有手握算力供给的玩家都有自己的生意要保护，只有彻底放弃推理和云业务、只做中立撮合的人，才能让这个价格被所有人信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力交易</span><span class=\"tag\">物理结算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"James Marriott on the End of Reading Reading Revolution Republic of Letters ethnolinguistic fractionalization post-literate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-goodfight-识字真正训练的不是知识-而是把情绪逐出说理的能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>识字真正训练的不是知识，而是把情绪逐出说理的能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马里奥特认为，识字真正的作用是把魅力、情绪等非理性说服手段逐出公共说理；读写衰退，意味着靠人格和情绪煽动的政治正卷土重来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阅读衰退</span><span class=\"tag\">识字与民主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Anthropic Gives Away 5% of Its Shares, Clone’s Muscle Robot, ElevenLabs Steals Podcaster&#x27;s Voice Public Benefit Corporation (PBC) McKibben muscle antagonistic actuation preference stack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-twist-人形机器人新方案-水压人工肌肉造价只要电机拉线的十分之一/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebb4c2b15536a9a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>人形机器人新方案：水压人工肌肉造价只要电机拉线的十分之一</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Clone Robotics 不用电机拉线去模拟肌肉，而是给编织套管里的弹性管加压液体让它直接收缩，CEO称这套方案造价只要电机驱动人形机器人的十分之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人工肌肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A World Model of Life: Biohub&#x27;s Alex Rives on Virtual Cells, Measurement, &amp; the $1.8B Data Push ESM AlphaFold RLVR laser phase plate cryo-electron tomography organoids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-cogrev-18亿美元押注的不是数据量-而是重新定义怎么-看见-细胞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c97e57b81c6b9f77-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>18亿美元押注的不是数据量，而是重新定义怎么「看见」细胞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alex Rives认为虚拟细胞模型多年做不出来，真正瓶颈不是算力或数据量不够，而是我们对细胞内部能观测到的东西太有限——测量能力才是模型的天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">虚拟细胞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Everyone Has a Health Expert in Their Pocket? | OpenAI’s Karan Singhal Move 37 HealthBench Professional A1C EHR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-a16z-openai做医疗ai不走专科模型路线-赌的是通用模型会持续变强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI做医疗AI不走专科模型路线，赌的是通用模型会持续变强</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">专科医疗模型很快会被通用前沿模型甩开，OpenAI选择把数百名医生提供的专科数据训练进每一代GPT里，而不是单独做一个医疗专用模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗AI</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"509 通往战时陪都之路：卢作孚建设重庆北碚往事\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-cn2aa250-一个剿匪的民团-如何变成重庆工业化的发动机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>一个剿匪的民团，如何变成重庆工业化的发动机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">重庆后来的军工基因不是抗战才种下的：卢作孚把一个原本只管剿匪的团练局，改造成了修铁路、开科学院的地方政府雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民国史</span><span class=\"tag\">地方自治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Beyond chores: How to teach kids to notice what needs to be done and share the mental load with Sam Kelly mental load noticing walk notice and do preexisting motivators dandelion effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-secureattach-真正该教孩子的不是做家务-而是-注意到-需要做什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>真正该教孩子的不是做家务，而是「注意到」需要做什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者花一年教会丈夫主动发现家务，却惊觉自己仍在替孩子做「注意」这部分工作——这个代际循环，她决定从孩子这一代开始打破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理负荷</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Christina Cacioppo - Building an Enduring Software Company in the Age of AI - [Invest Like the Best, EP.496] FDE harness outcome pricing trust graph\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-ilt-vanta情愿倒贴ai成本-也不敢把token费用转嫁给客户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4850cdb6fa3385e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">57:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>Vanta情愿倒贴AI成本，也不敢把token费用转嫁给客户</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用户精明到一眼能算出你在加价转卖Claude的token,所以Vanta宁可自己吃成本、把更多客户推进agent式使用，定价的事留到以后再解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SaaS定价</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CME&#x27;s Terry Duffy on the Disconcerting State of Finance Regulation self-certification perpetual futures funding rate core principle KYC 1256 tax treatment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-oddlots-芝商所ceo-两千五百份监管申报全部通过-一个没被拒绝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">29:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>芝商所CEO：两千五百份监管申报全部通过，一个没被拒绝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国商品期货交易委员会近两千五百份新产品申报无一被拒，连「大胃王吃几个热狗」都能过审——芝商所CEO Terry Duffy说这等于监管名存实亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融监管</span><span class=\"tag\">永续期货</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Ep 225 Peptides: What your peptide dealer doesn’t want you to know GLP-1 compounding pharmacy 503A bulks list halo effect acromegaly\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-tpwky-fda换掉审查委员后-被警示有风险的肽类产品照样获批/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>FDA换掉审查委员后，被警示有风险的肽类产品照样获批</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科学审查小组对七种流行肽类全票给出安全警示，但RFK换掉八名委员后的新班子几乎全票放行，监管结论和政治任命之间的裂缝被摆上了台面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肽类</span><span class=\"tag\">灰色市场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to Handle Halloween Group Costume Drama | Dr. Tori Cordiano overdetermination group think helping without fixing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-asklisa-万圣节装扮吵的不是服装-是谁说了算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a66bc85f3dcba29e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>万圣节装扮吵的不是服装，是谁说了算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">七年级女孩的团体万圣节装扮之争，表面在争服装款式，实则是谁被排除、谁手握社交权力的较量——装扮只是把这场谈判摆上台面的容器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">同伴关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can the polygraph test really spot a lie? Frye ruling Employee Polygraph Protection Act security theater cardiopneumopsychograph\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-throughline-测谎仪不测谎-测的是让人认罪的心理恐惧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b48f118d14260753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>测谎仪不测谎，测的是让人认罪的心理恐惧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国法院从不信测谎仪的科学性，却允许警察靠它逼出口供——它的价值从来不是测谎，而是靠心理恐惧制造认罪和持续监视。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">测谎仪</span><span class=\"tag\">职场监控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The MATCH Act and China’s DUV Imports DUV EUV SME FDPR countrywide control / entity control NXT:1980\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-chinatalk-一款仍在放行的光刻机-可能在十年内让中国芯片产能追平美国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96067a661c27c771-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>一款仍在放行的光刻机，可能在十年内让中国芯片产能追平美国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国智库测算：只要继续放行这款浸没式光刻机，十年后中国芯片产能可能逼近甚至追平美国；一旦彻底断供，这个可能性就被永久关闭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">光刻机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E256｜Agent、机器人与制药，谁先被GPT-6 Astra改写？ Computer Use TAMP Real-to-Sim MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-sv101-astra让机器人一步跨进gpt时刻-却在ai制药撞上验证墙/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>Astra让机器人一步跨进GPT时刻，却在AI制药撞上验证墙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">机器人因为能自我反思迭代而实现质变，但AI制药设计分子只需几小时，真实验证却要老鼠和猴子的新陈代谢周期，这道墙没有任何模型能跨过。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dylan Field: Is AI Replacing Designers?, Design is the New Code &amp; Democratizing Creativity SaaS apocalypse (Saspocalypse) Overton window MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-allin-不是-ai-抬高了创造力天花板-是人自己在抬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82dd95dca9a9be1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>不是 AI 抬高了创造力天花板，是人自己在抬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Figma 创始人说，几年前他曾预言 AI 会抬高创意的天花板，现在他承认说错了——AI 只是把做东西的门槛降低了，真正把天花板往上推的，只有愿意大胆冒险的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Figma</span><span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Audio long read: How to stay smart in the age of AI — the science of critical thinking metacognition lateral reading inoculation (against misinformation) illusion of understanding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-naturepod-ai没把批判性思维教育搞砸-它本来就没被教好过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">16:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>AI没把批判性思维教育搞砸——它本来就没被教好过</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">批判性思维教育本就没做好，AI只是让问题提前摊牌；唯一被证据支持的解法不是禁用AI,而是让学习保持「摩擦感」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">批判性思维</span><span class=\"tag\">AI教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 402: Plato Talks Homer: Hippias Minor and Ion (Part Two) techne rhapsode eudaimonia mimesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-pel-苏格拉底证明-存心作恶的人比无心作恶的人更优越/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b252022407fe296f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>苏格拉底证明：存心作恶的人比无心作恶的人更优越</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这与法律直觉完全相反——蓄意杀人比过失杀人判得更重，但苏格拉底靠跑步、瘸腿的脚和迷路的舵手，一步步把听众绕进这个结论。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柏拉图对话录</span><span class=\"tag\">苏格拉底</span>\n</div></div></a>"]